OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells and occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy showers, wintry over higher
OL,7,Fmountains, the showers easing a little
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon and evening.
OL,9,FOccasionally fresh southwesterly then
OL,10,Fnorthwesterly winds, easing later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers become confined to
OL,13,Fthe north overnight with long clear
OL,14,Fspells developing elsewhere. Winds
OL,15,Faway from the north falling light,
OL,16,Fbringing a risk of frost in well-
OL,17,Fsheltered parts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
