OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F175A1791375538
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA few early showers in
OL,6,Fnorth, otherwise a chilly start with
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Cloud increases from the
OL,8,Fwest with occasionally heavy rain
OL,9,Fspreading east through the afternoon.
OL,10,FStrengthening southerly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,13,Fclearing overnight to leave sunny
OL,14,Fspells and blustery showers Friday,
OL,15,Fthe showers becoming heavier, more
OL,16,Ffrequent Saturday with coastal gales.
OL,17,FMainly dry and bright on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
